  "ruleText": "Ins 1406.19 Reinsurance Facility Rates. The facility rates shall be developed utilizing data generated by the facility and filed for approval pursuant to the provisions of RSA 412:15 and RSA 412:16.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Ins 1400) #13162, eff 1-25-21; ss by #13534, eff 1-24-23",
